      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To start, you need to identify the requirements for your trip."
      ],
      "justification": "The opening clause implicitly triggers the start node and describes the initial requirement identification and trip type selection steps."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n3"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If you choose \"Select one way\""
      ],
      "justification": "The conditional clause establishes the XOR branch and defines the first alternative action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "if you choose \"Select return\""
      ],
      "justification": "Defines the second alternative action on the exclusive path."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n5"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After that, you will need to select the departure city"
      ],
      "justification": "\"After that\" signals the rejoining of the two choice paths before the departure city selection begins."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n6"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "and then the destination city.",
        "Once you have chosen the destination city"
      ],
      "justification": "Covers both the instruction to pick the destination and the acknowledgment of its completion."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n7"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "proceed to select the class.",
        "Once the class is selected"
      ],
      "justification": "Covers the instruction to pick the class and its completion state."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "choose your seat.",
        "After selecting your seat"
      ],
      "justification": "Covers the instruction to pick a seat and the subsequent trigger."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n9"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "enter the type and number of passengers.",
        "Once you have entered this information"
      ],
      "justification": "Covers the instruction to input passenger details and the confirmation trigger."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n10"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "continue to the flight selection.",
        "completed the flight selection"
      ],
      "justification": "Covers the transition to flight selection and its completion."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n11"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
